  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5405.03 Individual Trip Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5405.03 Individual Trip Records. The individual trip records that a transportation network company is required to keep pursuant to RSA 376-A:16, I, shall be kept for 1 year following the trip, or during any investigation conducted by the transportation network company into a complaint by the rider to whom the individual trip records pertain, whichever is longer.\n\nSource. #12491, eff 4-2-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5400.html"
